From: Kevin Raneri <kevin.raneri@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Nov 2021 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pufferfish: Optimize suffocation

License: GPL-3.0-only (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html)
Original patch from Pufferfish (https://github.com/pufferfish-gg/Pufferfish).
Ported to 1.21.11 with reference to Gale's "Reduce in wall checks".

The isInWall check to determine suffocation is quite expensive, and
often is completely unnecessary to check. We do two things here to
improve this:

1. We only check for suffocation once every N ticks (configurable in
reef.yml, default 10). Because of the no-damage ticks after being hurt,
this is extremely difficult for players to notice.

2. We additionally check whether the entity can even take damage right
now. This is much cheaper than the suffocation check itself.

Setting optimizations.check-stuck-in-wall-interval to 1 restores
vanilla behaviour.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java
@@ -440,7 +440,10 @@ public abstract class LivingEntity extends Entity implements Attackable, Waypoin
         profilerFiller.push("livingEntityBaseTick");
         if (this.isAlive() && this.level() instanceof ServerLevel serverLevel1) {
             boolean flag = this instanceof Player;
-            if (this.isInWall()) {
+            // Reef start - Pufferfish - Optimize suffocation
+            final int checkStuckInWallInterval = dev.reef.ReefConfig.checkStuckInWallInterval;
+            if ((checkStuckInWallInterval <= 1 || (this.tickCount % checkStuckInWallInterval == 0 && this.couldPossiblyBeHurt(1.0F))) && this.isInWall()) {
+                // Reef end - Pufferfish - Optimize suffocation
                 this.hurtServer(serverLevel1, this.damageSources().inWall(), 1.0F);
             } else if (flag && !serverLevel1.getWorldBorder().isWithinBounds(this.getBoundingBox())) {
                 double d = serverLevel1.getWorldBorder().getDistanceToBorder(this) + serverLevel1.getWorldBorder().getSafeZone();
@@ -1150,6 +1153,12 @@ public abstract class LivingEntity extends Entity implements Attackable, Waypoin
         return this.getHealth() <= 0.0F;
     }

+    // Reef start - Pufferfish - Optimize suffocation
+    private boolean couldPossiblyBeHurt(float amount) {
+        return !((float) this.invulnerableTime > (float) this.invulnerableDuration / 2.0F) || !(amount <= this.lastHurt);
+    }
+    // Reef end - Pufferfish - Optimize suffocation
+
     @Override
     public boolean hurtServer(ServerLevel level, DamageSource damageSource, float amount) {
         if (this.isInvulnerableTo(level, damageSource)) {
